@GameCatalogue.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5270
@baseUrl = {{GameCatalogue.Api_HostAddress}}/api/games

# Substitua pelo ID retornado no POST
@gameId = 000000000000000000000000

### Listar todos os jogos
GET {{baseUrl}}
Accept: application/json

### Buscar jogo por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{gameId}}
Accept: application/json

### Cadastrar jogo
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Elden Ring",
  "genre": "RPG",
  "platform": "PC",
  "releaseDate": "2022-02-25T00:00:00Z",
  "publisher": "Bandai Namco",
  "price": 229.90
}

### Cadastrar jogo com corpo inválido (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Sem dados"
}

### Atualizar jogo
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{gameId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Elden Ring",
  "genre": "RPG",
  "platform": "PC",
  "releaseDate": "2022-02-25T00:00:00Z",
  "publisher": "Bandai Namco",
  "price": 179.90
}

### Remover jogo
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{gameId}}

### Filtrar por gênero
GET {{baseUrl}}/genre/RPG
Accept: application/json

### Filtrar por plataforma
GET {{baseUrl}}/platform/Nintendo%20Switch
Accept: application/json

### Preço médio por gênero
GET {{baseUrl}}/average-price-by-genre
Accept: application/json

###
